{"sourceUrl":"https://marxism.njupt.edu.cn/2026/0616/c3719a304993/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:01.763284+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://marxism.njupt.edu.cn/2026/0616/c3719a304993/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><p><span><span><span>为增进全国各高校本科生对</span><span><span>学院</span></span><span>学科特色、师资力量及研究生培养体系的深入了解，搭建高水平学术交流与师生互动平台，</span><span><span>选拔有培养潜质的优秀本科生继续深造，马克思主义学院将</span></span><span>于</span></span></span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span><span><span>月举办</span><span><span>线上“</span></span></span></span><span>2026</span><span><span><span>年全国优秀本科生学院开放日活动</span><span><span>”</span></span><span>。现诚邀全国各高校有志于马克思主义理论研究的优秀本科生踊跃报名参加。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>一、</strong></span><span><span><strong>学院概况</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span>学院前身是</span><span>1958</span><span>年成立的政治理论教研室。历经</span><span>1978</span><span>年组建的马列主义教研室、</span><span>1987</span><span>年成立的社会科学部、</span><span>2008</span><span><span><span>年更名的人文与社会科学学院</span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span><span>2011</span><span>年</span><span>3</span><span>月，学校按照教育部要求，成立独立的马克思主义学院。</span><span>2022</span><span><span><span>年</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>入选江苏省高校示范马克思主义学院</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>马克思主义理论学科入选“十四五”江苏省重点学科</span><span><span>。现有思政课专任教师</span></span></span></span><span>98</span><span><span>人，其中教授</span></span><span>17</span><span><span>人、副教授</span></span><span>47</span><span><span>人，</span></span><span>90%</span><span><span>以上拥有博士学位。现有硕士研究生导师</span></span><span>23</span><span><span>人，博士研究生导师</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>人。</span></span><span>20</span><span><span>余人次荣获国家“W人计划”哲学社会科学领军人才，省“</span></span><span>333</span><span><span>高层次人才工程”“社科优青”“青蓝工程”“领航</span></span><span>·</span><span><span>扬帆”优秀思政课教师等省部级以上人才称号。</span></span><span>20</span><span><span>余人次担任教育部高等学校历史学类专业指导委员会委员、</span></span><span>21</span><span><span>世纪马克思主义研究会常务理事、省哲法史学类研究生教指委主任委员、省思政课教指委委员等学术兼职。</span></span></p><p><span>学院除拥有省示范马院、省重点学科支撑平台之外，还拥有中央网信办国家级智库平台“网络空间国际治理研究基地”、教育部国家“大思政课”共建实践教学基地、江苏省习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想研究中心南京邮电大学基地、江苏省重点决策咨询研究基地“江苏现代信息社会研究基地”、江苏高校哲学社会科学重点研究基地“物联网产业发展研究基地”等省级及以上教学科研平台。学院建有“网络意识形态安全治理研究中心”“邮政史研究中心”“电信史研究中心” </span><span>3</span><span>个校级科研机构。</span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>二</strong></span></span><span><strong>、硕士研究生招生专业介绍</strong></span></span></span></p><center><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span>招生专业代码</span></p></td><td><p><span>招生专业名称</span></p></td><td><p><span>学位类型</span></p></td><td><p><span>学习方式</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>联系方式</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>030500</span></p></td><td><p><span>马克思主义</span></p><p><span>理论</span></p></td><td><p><span>学术型</span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>周老师</span></span><span><span>025-85866893</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></center><p><span><span><span>本学科</span><span><span>设有</span></span><span>马克思主义基本原理、马克思主义中国化研究、思想政治教育和中国近现代史基本问题研究四个方向。</span></span></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>马克思主义基本原理。涉及马克思主义经典文本、马克思主义基本范畴、马克思主义与当代社会思潮等领域。聚焦马克思主义意识形态理论、网络社会思潮和网络意识形态话语创新等内容。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>马克思主义中国化研究。涉及马克思主义中国化重要文献、历史进程和基本经验研究、习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想等领域。聚焦网络强国和文化强国建设、网络文化安全、网络生态治理、网络舆情引导等内容。</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>思想政治教育。涉及思想政治教育基本原理、网络思想政治教育方法创新、中国共产党思想政治教育史与基本经验等领域。聚焦网络思想政治教育理论与方法创新发展和网络意识形态安全预警体系建设等内容。</span></p><p><span>4.</span><span>中国近现代史基本问题研究。涉及中国近现代史“四个选择”问题、中国特色社会主义道路发展的历史和规律等领域。聚焦中国近现代邮政事业发展与社会变迁、中国近现代邮政史料整理、红色邮政文化等内容。</span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>三</strong></span></span><span><strong>、</strong></span><span><span><strong>招生对象</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>具有法学类、哲学类、史学类、文学类、管理类、教育学类、军事学类、工学类等专业背景的优秀三年级本科生（</span><span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span>年毕业）；</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>遵守宪法和法律，德行良好、诚实守信、学风端正、身体健康，未受过任何形式的处分； </span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>学习成绩优秀，本科期间总评成绩排名在本专业前</span><span>30%</span><span>之内或综合表现优异（如已发表高质量学术论文，被授予重量级荣誉奖项，或获得高质量职业证书等）；</span></p><p><span>4.</span><span>立志从事马克思主义理论相关研究，具有一定的科研和创新能力，并且有意于推免、报考南京邮电大学马克思主义学院；</span></p><p><span>5.</span><span>英语水平良好。</span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>四</strong></span></span><span><strong>、</strong></span><span><span><strong>报名</strong></span></span><span><strong>流程</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>申请人于</span><span><strong>202</strong></span><span><span><strong>6</strong></span></span><span><strong>年</strong></span><span><span><strong>7</strong></span></span><span><strong>月</strong></span><span><span><strong>1</strong></span></span><span><strong>日</strong></span><span><strong>17</strong></span><span><strong>:</strong></span><span><span><strong>00</strong></span><span><strong>前</strong></span><span>将报名材料发送至</span><span><span>链接</span></span><span>：</span></span><span>https://yunbiz.wps.cn/c/collect/cdu8HSWBHCc</span><span><span><span>，此后不</span><span><span>再</span></span><span>接收报名材料</span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>材料</span></span><span>请按</span><span><strong>“</strong></span><span><span><strong>学校全称</strong></span></span></span></span><span><strong>+</strong></span><span><strong>姓名</strong></span><span><strong>+</strong></span><span><span><span><span><strong>开放日报名</strong></span></span><span><strong>”</strong></span><span>格式命名。</span></span></span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>报名材料包含：</span><span><strong>注：请将（</strong></span><span><strong>3</strong></span><span><strong>）-</strong></span><span><strong>（</strong></span><span><strong>6</strong></span><span><strong>）合并成一个</strong></span><span><strong>PDF</strong></span><span><strong>。</strong></span></p><p><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）南京邮电大学马克思主义学院</span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span>年全国优秀</span><span><span>本科生学院开放日申请表</span></span><span>（见附件</span></span></span><span>1</span><span>，签字之后的扫描件）；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>2</span><span><span><span>）南京邮电大学马克思主义学院全国优秀</span><span><span>本科生学院开放日</span></span><span>个人陈述（见附件</span></span></span><span>2</span><span>）；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）身份证正反面扫描件（一页）；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）在校成绩单扫描件（需学校或院系教务部门盖章，若有特殊原因，可补交盖章版）；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>5</span><span>）英语水平证明材料扫描件（四六级、托福、雅思等）；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>6</span><span>）其他证明材料扫描件（如各类奖项、证书、已发表论文等）。</span></p><p><span><span><span><span>学院开放日</span></span><span>组委会组织评审小组，对申请人材料进行</span><span><span>筛选和评审</span></span><span>，</span><span><span><strong>录取名单</strong></span></span><span><strong>将于</strong></span></span></span><span><strong>202</strong></span><span><span><strong>6</strong></span></span><span><strong>年</strong></span><span><span><strong>7</strong></span></span><span><strong>月</strong></span><span><span><span><strong>5</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span><span><strong>前</strong></span><span><span><strong>在马克思主义学院网站</strong></span></span><span><strong>公布</strong></span><span><strong>。</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>五、</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>活动</strong></span></span><span><strong>安排</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>本次</span><span><span>学院开放日将于</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月中旬</span></span><span>采取腾讯会议形式进行，具体活动日期以学院通知为准。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>六</strong></span></span><span><strong>、</strong></span><span><span><strong>结果公布</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://marxism.njupt.edu.cn/2026/0616/c3719a304993/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span>此次开放日所有通知和优秀学员评选结果将于开放日结束后一周内通过学院网站（</span></span><span><span>http://marxism.njupt.edu.cn</span></span><span><span>）统一公布，请及时登录网站查阅相关信息。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>七</strong></span></span><span><strong>、注意事项</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>有关</span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span>年</span><span><span>开放日</span></span><span>活动的工作进度和有关安排，请随时关注学院网上通知</span><span><span>和</span></span></span></span><span><span>QQ</span></span><span><span><span><span>群通知</span></span><span>；</span></span></span></p><p><span>2.</span><span><span><span>本次</span><span><span>开放日</span></span><span>不收取报名费、资料费；</span></span></span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>申请人提交的材料必须真实、准确，一经发现弄虚作假，立即取消资格；</span></p><p><span>4.</span><span><span><span>申请人要求全程参加</span><span><span>开放日</span></span><span>活动，严格遵守</span><span><span>开放日的</span></span><span>要求与纪律，按时参加活动，无故缺席者将被立即取消</span><span><span>学员</span></span><span>资格。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>八</strong></span></span><span><strong>、联系方式</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span>学院地址：江苏省南京市栖霞区文苑路</span><span>9</span><span>号南京邮电大学（仙林校区）马克思主义学院</span></p><p><span>联系人：周老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：</span><span>025-85866893</span></p><p><span>联系邮箱：</span><span><a href=\"mailto:zhouaj@njupt.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">zhouaj@njupt.edu.cn</a></span></p><p><span>报名咨询 </span><span>QQ </span><span>群：</span><span>940505851</span><span><span>（报名开放日的同学请及时入群）</span></span></p><p><span>本通知未涉及部分，由本学院招生工作领导小组负责解释。</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><strong>南京邮电大学马克思主义学院</strong></span><span><strong>202</strong></span><span><span><strong>6</strong></span></span><span><span><span><strong>年全国优秀</strong></span><span><span><strong>本科生</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>开放日</strong></span></span><span><strong>欢迎你！</strong></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span>南京邮电大学马克思主义学院</span></p><p><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span>年</span><span><span>6</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>16</span></span><span>日</span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://marxism.njupt.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://marxism.njupt.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/20/3c/92ae885141d9b92c2a045a219512/38a76996-f4b9-4f80-a4dd-99fbe1c6954c.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1：南京邮电大学马克思主义学院2026年全国优秀本科生学院开放日申请表.docx</a><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://marxism.njupt.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://marxism.njupt.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/20/3c/92ae885141d9b92c2a045a219512/5788161c-712f-4599-91c8-dbdd66f7a956.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2：南京邮电大学马克思主义学院2026年全国优秀本科生学院开放日个人陈述.doc</a></p><p><br/></p><div><p><br/></p></div><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"809c4e15bce54a21f7dd74aa958a133693a1843296bc54bf27aab2ce70e0f126","textLength":2464,"sourceSha256":"358017e67cdfa64afe35de3dce2590cc53debbcb8be066b38b4acf9373a7b772","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-4d3255822c9f246a8c89","title":"2026年南京邮电大学马克思主义学院关于举办2026年全国优秀本科生学院开放日的通知（线上）","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:01.763284+00:00"}
